<li>Pah Wongso Pendekar Boediman (1940)</li>
<li>Tjioeng Wanara (1941)</li>
<li>Lintah Darat (1941)</li>
<li>Pah Wongso Tersangka (1941)</li>
<li>Ajah Berdosa (1941)</li>
<li>1001 Malam (tidak selesai)</li>
</ul>
